text:
#Botany2020 Today:2 talks &amp; 1 poster - @TrEE_Lab 
@asawarialbal presents what we found out about males in an andromonoecious system
@preeti_saryan presents a machine-learning algorithm in discovering clusters
@salony_susnata tests use of genomic content as a taxonomic character. https://t.co/N4NremEIta

